1
00:00:33,317 --> 00:00:38,347
The fire fades before the dawn.
2
00:00:40,077 --> 00:00:45,267
Silent echoes carry on.
3
00:00:46,819 --> 00:00:52,467
Every path is carved in stone.
4
00:00:53,517 --> 00:00:59,539
Every soul walks here alone.
5
00:01:00,139 --> 00:01:06,048
Shadows whisper through the trees.
6
00:01:06,867 --> 00:01:12,347
Calling names upon the breeze.
7
00:01:13,368 --> 00:01:19,267
Steel will break and kingdoms fall.
8
00:01:20,139 --> 00:01:25,339
Death has waited for us all.
9
00:01:26,608 --> 00:01:32,077
No hand will lift you from the ground.
10
00:01:33,299 --> 00:01:38,877
No light remains when hope is drowned.
11
00:01:40,139 --> 00:01:52,867
Born into death. Skill decides the end.
12
00:01:53,699 --> 00:01:59,568
One more step into the night.
13
00:02:00,128 --> 00:02:06,477
One more breath before the end.
14
00:02:06,957 --> 00:02:19,619
Born into death. Skill decides the end.
15
00:02:23,499 --> 00:02:28,568
Leave your fear beyond the gate.
16
00:02:29,939 --> 00:02:35,848
The Reaper waits with endless patience.
17
00:02:36,888 --> 00:02:42,579
Every scar becomes a name.
18
00:02:43,437 --> 00:02:49,397
Every victory feeds the flame.
19
00:02:50,139 --> 00:02:55,899
Gold will rust and crowns will fade.
20
00:02:56,768 --> 00:03:02,547
Only legends still remain.
21
00:03:03,307 --> 00:03:09,101
Trust is brittle. Steel remembers.
22
00:03:09,539 --> 00:03:16,219
Every stranger could become your end.
23
00:03:16,699 --> 00:03:22,757
The world keeps nothing. The world forgives nothing.
24
00:03:22,979 --> 00:03:30,099
Only those remembered by their deeds remain.
25
00:03:30,267 --> 00:03:42,848
Born into death. Skill decides the end.
26
00:03:43,528 --> 00:03:49,299
Write your name across the darkness.
27
00:03:49,987 --> 00:03:56,867
Before the silence speaks again.
28
00:03:57,027 --> 00:04:10,128
Born into death. Skill decides the end.
29
00:04:16,837 --> 00:04:19,608
When the Reaper calls your name,
30
00:04:22,299 --> 00:04:26,379
Another soul begins the journey.
